{"4079330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chamberlore", "steam_appid": 4079330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chamberlore</strong> is an experimental simulation.  Two players are sent together to train an artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <i>CynthiMind Technologies</i>, the AI named <strong>Actisluna</strong> is designed to understand human behavior, emotional responses, and moral decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles together, traverse dangerous testing chambers, and explore the dark rooms of human consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you take shapes the mind of <i>Actisluna</i>.  <br><br>🎮 <strong>The Power of Playing Together: </strong>This game is designed for two players.  <br><br>💞 <strong>With Your Partner, Lover, or Friend: </strong>Choose carefully who you’ll play with to train <i>Actisluna</i>.  <br><br>🧠 <strong>Puzzles, Observations, Decisions: </strong>Sometimes you’ll need logic, sometimes emotions, to decide your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><br>⚡ <strong>In Short, What Awaits You</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven two-player co-op experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep puzzles with themes of mind and ethics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testing chambers with diverse atmospheres</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chamberlore</strong> is an experimental simulation.  Two players are sent together to train an artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <i>CynthiMind Technologies</i>, the AI named <strong>Actisluna</strong> is designed to understand human behavior, emotional responses, and moral decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles together, traverse dangerous testing chambers, and explore the dark rooms of human consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you take shapes the mind of <i>Actisluna</i>.  <br><br>🎮 <strong>The Power of Playing Together: </strong>This game is designed for two players.  <br><br>💞 <strong>With Your Partner, Lover, or Friend: </strong>Choose carefully who you’ll play with to train <i>Actisluna</i>.  <br><br>🧠 <strong>Puzzles, Observations, Decisions: </strong>Sometimes you’ll need logic, sometimes emotions, to decide your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><br>⚡ <strong>In Short, What Awaits You</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven two-player co-op experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep puzzles with themes of mind and ethics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Testing chambers with diverse atmospheres</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Join the learning process of an artificial intelligence. A mysterious experiment awaits, where two people are sent to help it evolve.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Polish, Russian, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079330/4e798f06289efcf2696446434c40c9c160cdaf05/header.jpg?t=1765124447", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079330/51c8a15e76210fff9ba7cedfa612813dc3830efd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765124447", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079330/51c8a15e76210fff9ba7cedfa612813dc3830efd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765124447", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD